gin findloc call...\nfindloc( X > 0, T )\nThe first element where (i,j) > 0 is: ( 2 1) in column major order.\n"},"children":[],"key":"Bs63XegYEK"}],"key":"wgrIkJyclZ"}],"key":"dtNnxQQBRX"}],"key":"fAHRBZadVf"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}}}